axes.runtime:
A local process communicating over stdio;
container deployment (Docker / Podman) is also supported, but repository directories must be mounted explicitly.

A 2026-08-30 fix addressed security and compatibility issues of container bind mounts under Docker / Podman / SELinux.

mcp.transport:
Supports stdio. The README also gives container deployment (Docker / Podman)

and uvx / pip local installation (full-text verification 2026-10-08);
there is no official launch method for a remote transport (SSE / Streamable HTTP).
